# Input

```svelte
<div
    id="x"
    class="y"
    title="A really long title"
    hidden
    on:click={do_something}
    draggable="false"
    data-my-prop>
</div>

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -5,5 +5,4 @@
     hidden
     on:click={do_something}
     draggable="false"
-    data-my-prop>
-</div>
+    data-my-prop></div>
```

# Output

```svelte
<div
    id="x"
    class="y"
    title="A really long title"
    hidden
    on:click={do_something}
    draggable="false"
    data-my-prop></div>
```
